(205, NULL, NULL, 5, 14, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'RE-NY024 Wireless Stereo  Headphone', 're-ny024-wireless-stereo--headphone', 500, 1450.00, 1350.00, 840.00, 840, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<h2><strong>Specifications:&nbsp;</strong>RE-NY024 Wireless Stereo Sound Headphone</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Brand Name&nbsp;:</strong>&nbsp;RECRSI</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Product Type&nbsp;:</strong>&nbsp;Over-the-Ear Headphones</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Model&nbsp;:</strong>&nbsp;RE-NY024</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Bluetooth Version&nbsp;:</strong>&nbsp;V5.3</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Battery Capacity&nbsp;:</strong>&nbsp;500mAh</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Wireless distance&nbsp;:</strong>&nbsp;10meters</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Headset Conversation time&nbsp;:</strong>&nbsp;About 6 Hours</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Headset sound Time&nbsp;:</strong>&nbsp;About 6 H</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Headset Standby time&nbsp;:</strong>&nbsp;More than 10 hrs</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Frequency response&nbsp;:</strong>&nbsp;2402~2480mhZ</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '1807610809pro_mainRE-NY024 Wireless Stereo  Headphone.jpg', 'hot', 1, '2024-10-28 19:55:21', '2024-11-11 09:10:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>আগে পণ্য দেখে নিন, তারপরে ডেলিভারি ম্যানকে টাকা দিন। ব্যবহার&nbsp;করা পণ্য ফেরতযোগ্য নয়।&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"tel:01648177071\"><strong>Call Us:</strong>&nbsp;+8801648177071</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"mailto:banggomartbd@gmail.com\"><strong>Email:</strong>&nbsp;banggomartbd@gmail.com</a></p>', NULL, 0, 205, 'https://cmp.banggomart.com/product/images/1807610809pro_mainRE-NY024 Wireless Stereo  Headphone.jpg'),
(206, NULL, NULL, 5, 14, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'JBL Bluetooth Headphone Ms-881A Professional ', 'jbl-bluetooth-headphone-ms-881a-professional ', 500, 900.00, 850.00, 550.00, 550, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<h2><strong>Product details : </strong>JBL Bluetooth Headphone Ms-881A Professional&nbsp;</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Brand : </strong>JBL China Copy</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Model : </strong>881A</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Serial : </strong>High Professional</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Color :</strong> Black Red &amp; Blue</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Enhanced BASS</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Microphone included :</strong> Yes</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Noise Cancelling :</strong> Yes</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Style :</strong> High Performance Multifunctional Bluetooth Headphone</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Connectivity :</strong> Wireless ( Bluetooth ) OR Wired</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Folding Design : </strong>Rotating Ear-Cups</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Rechargeable Battery :</strong> Recharge via included USB</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Style : </strong>High Performance Multifunctional Bluetooth Headphone</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Serial :</strong> High Professional</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Color :</strong> Black Red &amp; Blue</li>\r\n	<li>Almost all Phones and Tablets support</li>\r\n	<li>TF Card/FM Stereo Radio/MP3 Player/Wireless/Bluetooth</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '1029141095pro_mainJBL Bluetooth Headphone Ms-881A Professional .jpg', 'hot', 1, '2024-10-28 20:16:24', '2024-10-28 20:16:44', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>আগে পণ্য দেখে নিন, তারপরে ডেলিভারি ম্যানকে টাকা দিন। ব্যবহার&nbsp;করা পণ্য ফেরতযোগ্য নয়।&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"tel:01648177071\"><strong>Call Us:</strong>&nbsp;+8801648177071</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"mailto:banggomartbd@gmail.com\"><strong>Email:</strong>&nbsp;banggomartbd@gmail.com</a></p>', NULL, 0, 206, 'https://cmp.banggomart.com/product/images/1029141095pro_mainJBL Bluetooth Headphone Ms-881A Professional .jpg'),
(207, NULL, NULL, 5, 14, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'JOYROOM T03s PRO 2 ANC Noise Cancellation Bluetooth Earbuds', 'joyroom-t03s-pro-2-anc-noise-cancellation-bluetooth-earbuds', 499, 1850.00, 1750.00, 1100.00, 1100, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<h1><strong>Product Description :&nbsp;</strong>JOYROOM&nbsp; T03s PRO 2 ANC Noise Cancellation Bluetooth Earbuds.</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>The Joyroom JR-T03S Pro 2 Wireless Earbuds in sleek white, paired with a stylish thin red case, represent the pinnacle of modern audio technology and design. Engineered for both aesthetics and performance, these earbuds deliver a superior listening experience with their advanced features and cutting-edge technology.</li>\r\n	<li>Bluetooth 5.2 technology ensures seamless and stable connectivity, allowing you to enjoy uninterrupted sound and clear calls. The 13mm speakers provide a robust sound experience with deep bass and clear highs, enhancing every note with high-fidelity audio. The earbuds boast a frequency response range of 20Hz to 20kHz, ensuring a full spectrum of sound reproduction.</li>\r\n	<li>Designed for convenience, these earbuds offer 7 hours of sound playtime on a single charge at 70% volume, with a quick 1-hour charging time for both the earbuds and the case. The 360mAh charging case supports extended usage and can keep your earbuds powered for longer periods. Additionally, the case&rsquo;s standby time exceeds 6 months, ensuring that your earbuds are always ready to go.</li>\r\n	<li>The Joyroom JR-T03S Pro 2 features active noise cancelling (ANC) with a depth of 25dB, reducing ambient noise to help you focus on your sound or calls. The 13mm diameter speakers expand the sound field and provide a high-quality bass effect, making every listening session immersive. The earbuds come with various silicone ear tips for a customizable fit, ensuring a stable and sealed experience.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h1><strong>Product details :&nbsp;</strong>JOYROOM&nbsp;T03s PRO 2</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Brand </strong>：JOYROOM&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Model :</strong> JR-T03s Pro</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Wearing method :</strong> in-ear</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Bluetooth&nbsp;:</strong> V5.2</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Earphone battery capacity : </strong>30mAh</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Charging case battery capacity :</strong> 360mAh</li>\r\n	<li><strong>sound time :</strong> 2 ~ 3h</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Call time :</strong> 2 ~ 3h</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Charging time of charging case :</strong> 1.3 hours</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Charging time of earphone :</strong> 1.2 hours</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '1082723732pro_mainJoyroom T03s PRO 2 ANC Noise Cancellation Bluetooth Earbuds.jpg', 'hot', 1, '2024-10-30 17:31:30', '2024-11-11 09:09:23', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>আগে পণ্য দেখে নিন, তারপরে ডেলিভারি ম্যানকে টাকা দিন। ব্যবহার&nbsp;করা পণ্য ফেরতযোগ্য নয়।&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"tel:01648177071\"><strong>Call Us:</strong>&nbsp;+8801648177071</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"mailto:banggomartbd@gmail.com\"><strong>Email:</strong>&nbsp;banggomartbd@gmail.com</a></p>', NULL, 0, 207, 'https://cmp.banggomart.com/product/images/1082723732pro_mainJoyroom T03s PRO 2 ANC Noise Cancellation Bluetooth Earbuds.jpg'),
(208, NULL, NULL, 3, 11, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Vacuum Flask Stainless Steel (500 ml flask)', 'vacuum-flask-stainless-steel-(500-ml-flask)', 500, 890.00, 790.00, 450.00, 450, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<h2><strong>Product Details :</strong> <strong>Vacuum Flask Stainless Steel (500 ml flask)&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Vacuum Flask Stainless Steel (500 ml flask)&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>Anti-corrosion Coating :&nbsp;Equipped</li>\r\n	<li>Boiling Water :&nbsp;Not applicable</li>\r\n	<li>Outdoor Activity : Hiking</li>\r\n	<li>Anti-corrosion Coating : Equipped</li>\r\n	<li>Boiling Water : Not applicable</li>\r\n	<li>Outdoor Activity : Hiking</li>\r\n	<li>Certification : CE / EU</li>\r\n	<li>Thermal Insulation Performance : Thermal Insulation</li>\r\n	<li>Applicable People : Adults</li>\r\n	<li>Material : Stainless Steel</li>\r\n	<li>Style : Classic</li>\r\n	<li>Color&nbsp;: Black , Silver , Blue , Green</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nVacuum Flask Stainless Steel (500 ml flask)&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />\r\n<img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/static/bd/p/9c2fb12e642d5c72a5731d74a93e4812.jpg_2200x2200q80.jpg_.webp\" /><img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/static/bd/p/e69adf0bea2aec5ab55035af9040d79f.jpg_2200x2200q80.jpg_.webp\" /><img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/static/bd/p/535c79afd5708fbc2fa4f9dce1ce4b90.jpg_2200x2200q80.jpg_.webp\" /><img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/static/bd/p/a90c5eecffc4701a25ce3d07f84b8360.jpg_2200x2200q80.jpg_.webp\" /><img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/static/bd/p/42150b20838cda0b1890925d143afc3d.jpg_2200x2200q80.jpg_.webp\" /><img src=\"https://img.drz.lazcdn.com/static/bd/p/4b2e3b4ab48c9d183b1601082a0b21fa.jpg_2200x2200q80.jpg_.webp\" /></p>', NULL, '2029695359pro_mainVacuum Flask Stainless Steel (500 ml flask).jpg', 'hot', 1, '2024-11-13 06:01:30', '2024-11-13 06:04:16', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>আগে পণ্য দেখে নিন, তারপরে ডেলিভারি ম্যানকে টাকা দিন। ব্যবহার&nbsp;করা পণ্য ফেরতযোগ্য নয়।&nbsp;</p>\r\