(213, NULL, NULL, 5, 18, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'HW 9 Mini Smart Watch', 'hw-9-mini-smart-watch', 500, 2390.00, 2190.00, 1650.00, 1650, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<h1><strong>Description :&nbsp;</strong>HW 9 Mini Smart Watch</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>The HW9 Mini Smartwatch is a low-cost smartwatch that comes with two straps. It has a 1.8-inch touchscreen display, and it supports Bluetooth calling and messaging. It also has several health and fitness tracking features, including heart rate monitoring, blood pressure monitoring, and blood oxygen monitoring. While some reviews mention blood sugar tracking, this capability is generally not recommended by medical professionals for smartwatches.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Full Specification :&nbsp;</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Item :&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>Smart Watch</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Display :&nbsp;</strong>1.8-Inch HD Touch Screen with 420 x 486p Resolution</li>\r\n	<li><strong>CPU :&nbsp;</strong>SF32LB551 Master chip</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Internal Memory :&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>256M</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Connectivity&nbsp;:&nbsp;</strong>Bluetooth V5.2</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Battery :&nbsp;</strong>350mAh</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Software :&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>Wear Fit pro</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Operating System :&nbsp;</strong>Android</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Gender : F</strong>emale&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Other Features :&nbsp;</strong>Weather, Stopwatch, Alarm, Timer, Calculator, Find Phone, Remote Sutter, Music Control, Mini Games</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Watch Color :</strong> Black, Pink, Silver &amp; Sky Blue</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>', NULL, '1038585478pro_mainHW 9 Mini Smart Watch.jpg', 'hot', 1, '2024-11-17 16:05:49', '2024-11-17 16:39:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<h2>আগে পণ্য দেখে নিন, তারপরে ডেলিভারি ম্যানকে টাকা দিন। ব্যবহার&nbsp;করা পণ্য ফেরতযোগ্য নয়।&nbsp;</h2>\r\n\r\n<h2><a href=\"tel:01648177071\"><strong>Call Us:</strong>&nbsp;+8801648177071</a></h2>\r